          "text": "Na yu kwa ũla ũtonya ũmũlũlũmĩlya, kwĩanana na ũvoo mũseo wakwa na ũtavan’yo wa Yesũ Klĩsto, kwĩanana na ũvuan’yo wa ĩla nzama yavithĩtwe vyũ mavindanĩ ma tene tene, ",
